Counter.scala: A counter implemented using semaphores.

SemaphorePartialQueue.scala: An implementation of a partial queue using
semaphores.  Includes CountingSemaphorePartialQueue, which uses a counting
semaphore.

SemaphoreBarrier.scala: Implementation of a barrier.

SemaphoreSynChan.scala: Implementation of a synchronous channel.

QueueLock.scala: A lock using a queue of semaphores to provide first-come,
first-served access.

SemaphoreReadersWriters.scala: A readers and writers lock

Exercises
=========

SemaphoreReadersWritersQueueLock.scala: Readers and writers, treating writers
in a first-come, first-served way.

SemaphoreProducerConsumer.scala: Producer-consumer example, where the consumer
receives an array.

Mod3S.scala: The mod-3 example.

BoundedSemaphorePartialQueue.scala: A bounded partial queue, implemented using
counting semaphores.

MenWomenSemaphore.scala: The men and women problem.